  "content": "\n\n<center><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sFx7o7p.png\" alt=\"標題\" /></p></center>\n<center><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshieldsio-patreon.vercel.app%2Fapi%3Fusername%3DMarsThePlanet%26type%3Dpatrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1158094?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deimos\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/deimos?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\" /></a>\n</strong></h5></center>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Deimos 是一款用於資料生成與設定的 Minecraft 函式庫。使用它，您可以產生設定檔，並在遊戲內原生地於 Forge 與 Neoforge 平台上顯示，或在 Fabric 平台上借助 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\">Mod Menu</a> 來顯示。Deimos 允許您在遊戲啟動時建立新的配方，使其內容可透過設定檔調整。這也表示您無需依賴 JSON 檔案，切換或升級 Minecraft 版本將變得更加輕鬆簡便。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">本函式庫的設定功能基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightlib\">MidnightLib</a>，由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/motschen/projects\">Motschen</a> 開發。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">我開發此模組是為了簡化我的開發流程，並讓我能跨所有模組載入器與 Minecraft 版本統一使用同一套設定函式庫。若您想了解如何在實際專案中運用此函式庫，歡迎查看我開發的其他 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/MarsThePlanet\">模組</a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/laser-bridges-and-doors\"><img alt=\"雷射橋樑與門 \" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1195/185/64/64/638770736607588151_animated.gif\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wishful-recipes\"><img alt=\"願望配方\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1821/680/64/64/639150887771985409.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-music-discs\"><img alt=\"更多音樂唱片 \" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/369/955/64/64/637539954760044673.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/server-side-horror\"><img alt=\"伺服器端恐怖元素\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1380/4/64/64/638895109610009518.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/exp-counter\"><img alt=\"經驗值計數器\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1179/179/64/64/638752204531779528.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fire-arrows-ignite-fire\"><img alt=\"火焰箭引發火災\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MSoi1ek.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/flat-exp-costs\"><img alt=\"固定經驗消耗\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1314/641/64/64/638854870713185428.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lava-turns-sand-into-glass\"><img alt=\"熔岩將沙子轉化為玻璃\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1179/182/64/64/638752210189574617.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cooked-carrots\"><img alt=\"烤胡蘿蔔\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tFPjbhV.png\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/husks-drop-sand\"><img alt=\"屍殼掉落沙子\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/376/68/64/64/637552001848895633.png\" /></a> \n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p></center>\n<h1>給開發者</h1>\n<p>以下為設定與使用 Deimos 的操作說明。若需了解更多關於此函式庫的細節，請務必前往其 <a href=\"https://github.com/Mars-The-Planet/Deimos\">GitHub 頁面</a> 查看。</p>\n<h2 id=\"setup\">環境設定</h2>\n<p>您可以直接使用我的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Mars-The-Planet/Multiloader-Templates-with-Deimos\">IntelliJ 範本</a>，它會自動建立已預先設定好 Deimos 的新 MultiLoader 專案；或者依照以下說明手動進行設定：</p>\n<h3 id=\"in-your-build-gradle-\">在 build.gradle 中</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-groovy\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">repositories</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-section\">maven</span> {\n        url = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"https://api.modrinth.com/maven\"</span>\n    }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"forge-and-neoforge-\">Forge 與 Neoforge：</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-groovy\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">dependencies</span> {\n    implementation <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"maven.modrinth:deimos:<span class=\"hljs-variable\">${project.deimos_version}</span>\"</span>\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"fabric-\">Fabric：</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-groovy\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">dependencies</span> {\n    modImplementation <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"maven.modrinth:deimos:<span class=\"hljs-variable\">${project.deimos_version}</span>\"</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//if you want to use modmenu</span>\n    modCompileOnly <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"com.terraformersmc:modmenu:<span class=\"hljs-variable\">${project.modmenu_version}</span>\"</span>\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>如果您需要使用 Mod Menu 的功能，則需要新增一個程式碼庫（repository）：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-groovy\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">repositories</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-section\">maven</span> {\n        name = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Terraformers\"</span>\n        url = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"https://maven.terraformersmc.com/\"</span>\n    }\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>您可以在 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deimos/versions\">Modrinth</a> 上找到所需的特定 Deimos 版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"how-to-use-it\">使用方法</h2>\n<h3 id=\"creating-configs\">建立設定檔</h3>\n<p>您可以在繼承自 DeimosConfig 的類別中加入設定項目：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-java\">public <span class=\"hljs-class\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">TestConfig</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">DeimosConfig</span> </span>{\n    <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Entry</span> public static int test_int = <span class=\"hljs-number\">6</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Entry</span> public static <span class=\"hljs-type\">List</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-type\">String</span>&gt; test_string_list = <span class=\"hljs-type\">Lists</span>.newArrayList(\n            <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"minecraft:acacia_planks\"</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"minecraft:andesite\"</span>);\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>接著，在您的初始化方法中，您需要這樣呼叫 DeimosConfig.init：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-java\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">DeimosConfig</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.init</span>(<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">MOD_ID</span>, <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">TestConfig</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.class</span>);\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"adding-new-recipes\">新增配方</h3>\n<p>要新增配方，請在初始化方法中呼叫 DeimosRecipeGenerator 的相關方法。您可以新增不規則合成、有框合成、燒煉、煙燻、吹煉、營火燒煉及石砧切割配方。以下是一些範例：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-java\">DeimosRecipeGenerator.createSmeltingJson(TestConfig.test_string_list.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>), TestConfig.test_string_list.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>), TestConfig.test_int, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.5</span>F);\n\nDeimosRecipeGenerator.createShapedRecipeJson(\n        Lists.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span><span class=\"hljs-type\">ArrayList</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'#'</span>),\n        Lists.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span><span class=\"hljs-type\">ArrayList</span>(ResourceLocation.parse(<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"sand\"</span>)),\n        Lists.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span><span class=\"hljs-type\">ArrayList</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"item\"</span>),\n        Lists.<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span><span class=\"hljs-type\">ArrayList</span>(\n                <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"# \"</span>,\n                <span class=\"hljs-string\">\" #\"</span>\n        ),\n        ResourceLocation.parse(<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"stone\"</span>), <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>);\n</code></pre>\n<p>請注意，您可以直接使用設定檔中的數值。若玩家修改後重新啟動遊戲，配方也會隨之變更。這項功能同樣適用於模組新增的物品。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\" /></a></p>",
